<li>The angle between the airfoil chord line and the relative wind.</li>
<li>Exceeding the wing’s critical angle of attack.</li>
<li>It increases stall speed.</li>
<li>It increases required lift and power and generally degrades launch and climb performance.</li>
<li>They reduce air density and can reduce aerodynamic and propeller performance.</li>
